suite.com/drive/folder/KuHgfghM3l6aRWdxEk8jOOfgp8d\">here</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>To use an Art Template:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Open the Printway template for your selected product in Photoshop or another design program.</li><li>Insert your artwork in a new layer,&nbsp;<strong>placing all important parts of your design within the designated “Safe zone” on the art template</strong>&nbsp;to ensure your design will not be cut off during the printing process.</li><li>If you’re designing drinkware, use the indicated centering lines to ensure your artwork is placed exactly where you’d like.</li><li>Hide or delete the Art Template layer from your file.</li><li>Save as a .png, .jpg, or another accepted file type.</li><li>You’ve now used a Printway template to create artwork exactly to the recommended specs for that product.<ul><li>Ensure all important elements of your design are within the safe zone on the product template.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>To ensure your design prints properly on each product:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Fill the entire design template!</strong>&nbsp;The outer edge of the template represents “Bleed Area,” which signifies the areas which may print on the outer edges of your product.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li><i><strong>Failure to fill the bleed area will likely result in unprinted white unprinted areas around the edge of your product.&nbsp;</strong></i></li></ul>", "displayPrice": {"US": 9.1}, "mockupUrls": ["https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651a7c453785e8161c612baf_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/648bd4562776046ad4fcf3dd_800x800.jpg", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651a7c479f47f1e619d96879_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651a7c4751de65703d5bdcbd_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651a7c46fee0ecc0718548a1_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651a7c46af8b18e2bd8cf7f0_800x800.png", "https://cdn.printway.io/lzi/651a7c46ad0d0893de9252c2_800x800.png"], "videoUrls": null, "choose